al factories have their own shifts. Confirm the exact appointment and attending staff; a general national calendar cannot establish their availability."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use a Chinese gender calendar to predict a baby’s sex?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A traditional gender chart is folklore, not a reliable prediction method. It is separate from the date and holiday information covered here."}}]};
